  "note": "Independent re-judgment against RFC 2918 Section 4 ('Otherwise, the BGP speaker shall re-advertise to that peer the Adj-RIB-Out of the <AFI, SAFI> carried in the message, based on its outbound route filtering policy.') after commits 5cee119174, ea4b3b6f44, and 109395f25d. In runRIBPlugin (rib.go), adding selected.setOnSettled(r.sourceLeases.notify) only wakes source lease settlement after selected dispatch settles and does not alter refresh dispatch or Adj-RIB-Out replay. In Reactor.exportFilterFromFacts (egress_inject_filter.go), passing &session by pointer to runEgressPolicyChainASN4 is a pure pointer refactor with identical export policy evaluation. In Reactor.notifyOneMessage (reactor_notify.go), adding partialDenied / enqueueFilteredIngress for rs-client partial-denied ingress retention on update-filtered does not affect sent feedback, refresh handling, or Adj-RIB-Out replay. All eight tagged test bindings (four RIB unit roots, three reactor unit bindings, and test/plugin/refresh-config-static.ci) and all other 28 cited producers are byte-identical.",
